---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAFA]">

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav id="navbar" class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-[#FAFAFA] px-8 py-6 flex justify-between items-center transition-shadow duration-300">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full flex justify-between items-center">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 group">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[#2563EB] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-[#F97316] transition-colors duration-300">
            <span class="font-mono text-white text-sm font-bold">SR</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-mono text-[#1A1A2E] text-sm font-medium hidden md:block">sroberts.dev</span>
        </a>
        <div class="flex gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-[#6B7280]">
          <a href="/about" class="text-[#1A1A2E]">About</a>
          <a href="/projects" class="hover:text-[#1A1A2E] transition-colors">Projects</a>
          <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-[#1A1A2E] transition-colors">Blog</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="hover:text-[#1A1A2E] transition-colors">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 pt-40 pb-16">
      <p class="font-mono text-[#F97316] text-sm mb-4 tracking-wider">About</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6 leading-tight">
        The story so far
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#6B7280] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Final year BSc Applied Computing student, Skills Wales competitor, and founder
        of CaerFortis - a cyber security awareness consultancy based in Caerphilly, Wales.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Narrative -->
    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 pb-24">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-16">
        <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            My interest in cyber security started almost by accident, back in Year 8.
             A substitute teacher caught me messing about with "View Page Source" during a lesson 
            - instead of telling me off, he pulled up Inspect Element and showed me how to actually change things on the page. 
            It was far more exciting than whatever we were supposed to be doing,
             and it's genuinely the moment I trace things back to.
          </p>
          <p>
            The interest stayed with me through school, mostly in the background - messing around on HackThisSite,
             making autorun USB sticks with script-kiddie batch files, that sort of thing. Nothing serious, just tinkering. 
             It didn't really take a meaningful turn until Level 3, 
             when my tutor Phil mentioned the college was looking for students to enter a cyber security competition. 
             That was enough to properly hook me - once I had access to Immersive Labs and could see myself on an organisational leaderboard, I was away.
          </p>
          <p>
            That competition turned out to be the Skills Wales national cyber security competition. 
            In the few months leading up to it, I worked through 164 labs on Immersive Labs - I was hooked immedciately,
             friendly competiton between peers turned into a serious interest and hobby. I placed 2nd, 
             up against apprentices who were already working in the industry, which told me something useful:
              I could hold my own against people with a real head start on me.
          </p>
          <p>
            In 2026 I plan to  found <a href="https://caerfortis.co.uk" class="text-[#2563EB] hover:text-blue-700">CaerFortis</a>,
            a cyber security consultancy delivering awareness training to small and
            medium businesses across South Wales. It's early - awareness training first,
            with more technical services planned as my qualifications catch up to the
            ambition.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Timeline -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="font-mono text-[#F97316] text-xs tracking-wider mb-2">Timeline</p>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[#2563EB] pl-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] text-sm">Level 3 ICT Systems Technician</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#6B7280]">Coleg y Cymoedd - 2023/24</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[#F97316] pl-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] text-sm">Skills Wales Cyber Security Competition</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#6B7280]">2nd Place, National - 2024</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[#2563EB] pl-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] text-sm">FdSc ICT Systems</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#6B7280]">University of South Wales - 2024/26</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[#6B7280] pl-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] text-sm">Volunteer Crew, El Galeón Andalucía</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#6B7280]">Cardiff to Plymouth</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[#F97316] pl-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] text-sm">CaerFortis Ltd - Founder</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#6B7280]">Cyber security consultancy - Est. 2026</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-[#2563EB] pl-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] text-sm">BSc Applied Computing</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#6B7280]">University of South Wales - 2026/27</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Back to home CTA -->
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A2E] py-16">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 text-center">
        <p class="text-[#6B7280] mb-6">Want to see what I've actually built?</p>
        <a href="/#projects" class="bg-[#F97316] text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors inline-block">
          View my projects
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-[#1A1A2E] border-t border-white/10 py-6">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 flex justify-between items-center">
        <span class="font-mono text-[#6B7280] text-sm">© 2026 Scott Roberts</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[#6B7280] text-sm">sroberts.dev</span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    const navbar = document.getElementById('navbar');
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      if (window.scrollY > 10) {
        navbar?.classList.add('shadow-md');
      } else {
        navbar?.classList.remove('shadow-md');
      }
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
